        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Stainless Steel Harmony Leverset AHI SIG121</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe AHI SIG121- has a round rose, and a flat block style straight grip.  This is a block style, almost \"cubism\" in appearance, gives a unique and blending accent to any home with modern decor. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe lever is all stainless steel, making it extremely resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches and abrasions. It will not degrade in appearance or function even after many years of use on your home or office. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis style lever is also available with a square rose, <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-studio-leverset-ahi-sig121-204\">AHI SIG121-204</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features of AHI SIG121 Stainless Steel Leversets:</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Width: 4.72\" (120mm)</li>\r\n<li>Grip Thickness: 0.31\" (8mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1.73\" (44mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose diameter: 2-1/2\" (61mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Residential and Commercial Doors</li>\r\n<li>Field reversible tubular latch</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for door thickness of 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" Pre-Drilled Doors)</li>\r\n<li>All Levers meet <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When choosing a function:</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Double Dummy: Stationary both sides of door</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<br>",
